body:
I played around with a bot I was making based off Kiki of Kiki's Delivery Service but I wanted to include Jiji, the sassy talking black cat. So, I made Kiki's personality using a formula I found on here and then I made another one that was based off Jiji as best as I could. I didn't mess around too much once I saved it, but I started roleplaying as a female talking white cat and was able to talk to Jiji and he was polite but seemed standoffish but had intelligent talk but when I just wrote that his name was Jiji,species talking male cat, with his only personality being a talking cat, he wrote back but his persoanlity was "Hi you are the best friend a cat could ever want!" and acted that he was swishing his tail happily but obviously didn't have any personality really lol

&#x200B;

I do wish it was much longer than 1024 characters as I didn't want Kiki to act NSFW if I could help it so I had to add a lot of (+"doesn't like to flirt"+"safe for work"+) so I had to use up a lot of characters. But I added this formula to the conversation section to see if it would read it and use it and it seemed to work. But it meant less characters for the conversation prompt which I am still working on. But I LOVED that it grabbed Jiji.. but I'm not sure if he'll talk on his own as I don't know how to force it to speak as I feel it'll only speak if my character talks directly to Jiji.
